    register_market_series_asset_class_handlers, register_observation_lineage_handlers,
    register_series_classification_rule_handlers.
    The history providers (registry : dispatch_registry&) return void:
    register_feed_binding_history_provider, register_market_series_history_provider,
    register_observation_lineage_history_provider,
    register_series_classification_rule_history_provider.
    Each handler registrar subscribes that table's handlers and returns the
    subscriptions; each history provider registers a history-diff provider for
    its entity with ores.history.
end note

