class ores::marketdata::repository::feed_binding_repository {
}
note right of "ores::marketdata::repository::feed_binding_repository"
Declares a nested enum class remove_status in its own body: removed,
conflicting, missing, unsupported. The pass draws namespace-scope types only,
so remove_status has no box. remove(id, version) returns it: removed when the
row was closed, conflicting when it moved on, missing when no current row
existed, unsupported when the store cannot answer the stated version.
market_fixing_repository, market_observation_repository,
market_series_asset_class_repository, market_series_repository,
observation_lineage_repository and series_classification_rule_repository each
declare the same enum in their own bodies.
end note

